          "message": {
            "text": "This follows Chromium CountersAttachmentContext rather than DOM recursion: RemoveStaleCounters retains a counter while its originating parent remains an ancestor, CreateCounter replaces an innermost same-parent peer, and directives execute reset/increment/set. Separate before/after snapshots preserve pseudo-tree order for generated counter content.",
            "markdown": "This follows Chromium CountersAttachmentContext rather than DOM recursion: RemoveStaleCounters retains a counter while its originating parent remains an ancestor, CreateCounter replaces an innermost same-parent peer, and directives execute reset/increment/set. Separate before/after snapshots preserve pseudo-tree order for generated counter content."
          },
          "locations": [
