          "message": {
            "text": "Chromium remains the projection oracle instead of Domotion reimplementing its transform-function decision tree. Zero-sized border-corner probes observe the already-composed Blink paint transform (perspective, origins, flattening, and preserve-3d); factoring each measured plane against its parent yields reusable vector geometry without codepoint- or fixture-specific matrices. Chromium revision 7d859f271cbda744098ac69f44978d4edfa62be3 was checked in paintpropertytree_builder.cc, including ApplyPerspectiveDepth and transform-node backface state.",
            "markdown": "Chromium remains the projection oracle instead of Domotion reimplementing its transform-function decision tree. Zero-sized border-corner probes observe the already-composed Blink paint transform (perspective, origins, flattening, and preserve-3d); factoring each measured plane against its parent yields reusable vector geometry without codepoint- or fixture-specific matrices. Chromium revision 7d859f271cbda744098ac69f44978d4edfa62be3 was checked in paint_property_tree_builder.cc, including ApplyPerspectiveDepth and transform-node backface state."
          },
