          "message": {
            "text": "Non-affine 3D contexts are snapshotted once at the outer context root and clipped to the capture viewport. The generated oracle proves projective perspective activates the snapshot while affine scale3d remains vector-native, and the preserve-3d visual fixture matches Chromium with zero differing pixels.",
            "markdown": "Non-affine 3D contexts are snapshotted once at the outer context root and clipped to the capture viewport. The generated oracle proves projective perspective activates the snapshot while affine scale3d remains vector-native, and the preserve-3d visual fixture matches Chromium with zero differing pixels."
