          "message": {
            "text": "DM-2448 exposed that host metrics had adopted computed size while text segments—the renderer’s preferred baseline source—still carried logical-size metrics. This post-pass remeasures each segment’s own face/style at effective-zoomed computed size and applies only transform scale. A logical-metric equality guard preserves bespoke initial-letter/synthetic metrics. The Chromium oracle covers direct/nested zoom and transforms, cancellation, mixed factors, Range/x origins, baselines, CDP face identity, optical inputs and emitted outline-scale ratios.",
            "markdown": "DM-2448 exposed that host metrics had adopted computed size while text segments—the renderer’s preferred baseline source—still carried logical-size metrics. This post-pass remeasures each segment’s own face/style at effective-zoomed computed size and applies only transform scale. A logical-metric equality guard preserves bespoke initial-letter/synthetic metrics. The Chromium oracle covers direct/nested zoom and transforms, cancellation, mixed factors, Range/x origins, baselines, CDP face identity, optical inputs and emitted outline-scale ratios."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
