            "text": "overflow-clip-margin px terms cross the effective-zoom boundary exactly once during capture, matching the existing physical paint-length policy. The browser-bound DM-2419 suite observes 8px becoming 10px under zoom 1.25 and produces identical captured clip geometry at deviceScaleFactor 1 and 2.",
