          "message": {
            "text": "Generated text inherits the host's kStandardFamily sentinel only when no matching author pseudo rule owns font-family. CSSOM exposes the same concrete settings face for inherited standard and an authored declaration of that exact face, so comparing strings would mislabel the latter; the joined author-rule seam in font-family-default.ts preserves that distinction before one structured record is threaded to every capture owner.",
            "markdown": "Generated text inherits the host's kStandardFamily sentinel only when no matching author pseudo rule owns font-family. CSSOM exposes the same concrete settings face for inherited standard and an authored declaration of that exact face, so comparing strings would mislabel the latter; the joined author-rule seam in font-family-default.ts preserves that distinction before one structured record is threaded to every capture owner."
          },
